              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'amukozyaga hangi' malwa sav'o, na wu'ziku' wenu'wo, mwaniki' mudo wayaga ku'kalala nawe. Ali'vi ise akamanyile ku'v'a alalile na mwane ninga aho wahafumaga henanho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.35",
